{"id":"4cce6c7a39335fa2","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-swingbanzhaf.md","title":"Swing counts and normalized Banzhaf indices","display":"df-swingbanzhaf — Swing counts and normalized Banzhaf indices","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-swingbanzhaf","aliases":["27-df-swingbanzhaf"],"display":"df-swingbanzhaf — Swing counts and normalized Banzhaf indices","depends_on":["[[27-df-vardom]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§1.13.3 Definitions 1.33–1.34","source_printed_pages":"57,58","source_pdf_pages":"81,82","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-swingbanzhaf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-swingbanzhaf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-swingbanzhaf — Swing counts and normalized Banzhaf indices"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.13.3 Definitions 1.33–1.34"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"57,58"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"81,82"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 及布尔向量的坐标域见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 非常值，且满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;((\\forall i\\in[n]\\;a_i\\le b_i)\\Rightarrow f(a)\\le f(b))\">\\(\\forall a,b\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;((\\forall i\\in[n]\\;a_i\\le b_i)\\Rightarrow f(a)\\le f(b))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[n]\">\\(k\\in[n]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^{k\\gets b}\">\\(a^{k\\gets b}\\)</span> 为下式定义的同维坐标更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a^{k\\gets b}\\coloneqq\\{(j,c)\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\mid(j=k\\land c=b)\\lor(j\\ne k\\land c=a_j)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a^{k\\gets b}\\coloneqq\\{(j,c)\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\mid(j=k\\land c=b)\\lor(j\\ne k\\land c=a_j)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_k(f)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid a_k=0\\land f(a)=0\\land f(a^{k\\gets1})=1\\},\\qquad s_k(f)\\coloneqq|S_k(f)|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_k(f)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid a_k=0\\land f(a)=0\\land f(a^{k\\gets1})=1\\},\\qquad s_k(f)\\coloneqq|S_k(f)|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta_k(f)\\coloneqq\\frac{s_k(f)}{\\sum_{i=1}^n s_i(f)},\\qquad\\sum_{i=1}^n s_i(f)&gt;0,\\qquad\\sum_{i=1}^n\\beta_i(f)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta_k(f)\\coloneqq\\frac{s_k(f)}{\\sum_{i=1}^n s_i(f)},\\qquad\\sum_{i=1}^n s_i(f)&gt;0,\\qquad\\sum_{i=1}^n\\beta_i(f)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>摇摆点记录某位玩家加入后由败转胜的联盟。非常值递增函数沿从全零到全一的坐标链至少有一次 0 到 1 的变化，故分母严格为正；原书的规范化 Banzhaf 指数因而良定义。常函数被排除，避免 0/0。本节的序条件是原书的 positive；仅要求原书较宽的 monotone（unate）不足以保证分母为正。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-vardom]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[n]$ 及布尔向量的坐标域见 [[27-df-vardom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;((\\forall i\\in[n]\\;a_i\\le b_i)\\Rightarrow f(a)\\le f(b))","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a^{k\\gets b}","display":false},{"tex":"a^{k\\gets b}\\coloneqq\\{(j,c)\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\mid(j=k\\land c=b)\\lor(j\\ne k\\land c=a_j)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"S_k(f)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid a_k=0\\land f(a)=0\\land f(a^{k\\gets1})=1\\},\\qquad s_k(f)\\coloneqq|S_k(f)|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta_k(f)\\coloneqq\\frac{s_k(f)}{\\sum_{i=1}^n s_i(f)},\\qquad\\sum_{i=1}^n s_i(f)>0,\\qquad\\sum_{i=1}^n\\beta_i(f)=1.","display":true}],"bytes":1962,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-swingbanzhaf|df-swingbanzhaf — Swing counts and normalized Banzhaf indices]]"},{"id":"d10bf908ef5dd0f3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原段落实际保留的修改主题包括投票指标的递增前提、零维距离记号、局部构造、索引及书内直接依赖。可对应阅读 [[27-df-swingbanzhaf]]、[[27-thm-swingchow]] 和 [[27-df-pbunimodality]]；本摘要不推断未列出的39个历史修改文件，也不凭数字3指定未给出的完整历史证据清单。"},{"id":"08633972042eedcd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 非常值，且满足 $\\forall a,b\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;((\\forall i\\in[n]\\;a_i\\le b_i)\\Rightarrow f(a)\\le f(b))$，$S_k(f),s_k(f)$ 见 [[27-df-swingbanzhaf]]。$\\omega,\\omega_k$ 是下节构造的真点计数，$k\\in[n]$。"}],"outgoing":["4b84ee77aaf0c828"]}